{"title":"Yeti","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 58 Yeti that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (2.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/yeti\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/yeti?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>92</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/yeti?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>227</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/yeti?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>154</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/yeti?lv=57\" title=\"Pick level 57\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>92</td><td>in the wilds around 438, -928</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/yeti\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>58</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>227</td><td>in the wilds around 443, -931</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/yeti?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>154</td><td>in the wilds around 447, -1002</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"yeti\" data-map-level=\"58\">Show level 58 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 10 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 14 recorded drops, 617 total, 18–148 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×18–148</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"yeti-fang\" title=\"Yeti Fang - in 7 of 10 looted corpses, 7 recorded drops, 15 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/b964f6987e786c9b807e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Yeti Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bones\" title=\"Bones - in 3 of 10 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 5 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c29e1ebe544dbfedca68.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bones</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonhide-legs\" title=\"Dragonhide Legs - in 1 of 10 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ab4bfdde0dada9a875e7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonhide Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=